notes = "Mossy garden-ground redesign: a continuous soft moss skin hugs the soil block, with one primary earth reveal and three differently sized supporting dirt spots. Vertex-colour gradients feather every reveal back into the moss; two rounded stones and three short grass tufts add contained character. Clean sides; no overhang, voxel noise, litter, or grit. Stable ID retained; no extracted source geometry is used."
